


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_ec18b4ed:


    "锅烧开了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_65c8abc0:


    "祥子做了海鲜锅。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b849469f:


    "阳菜、伦、圣夜子围着矮腿桌等着火锅做好。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_66673523:


    "文和祥子去了洗餐具的地方。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_941785c7:



    voice "2SA_0304"
    sachiko "「小文，谢谢你帮我做准备」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_f0f18fbd:


    "祥子一边用毛巾擦手一边道谢。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_c3509fe1:



    voice "2FU_0485"
    fumi "「不，我只是切了蔬菜而已。比起这个，祥子姐竟然会杀鱼，我很吃惊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_df6d2452:


    "文一边立起砧板一边说。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_4b375e8d:



    voice "2SA_0305"
    sachiko "「啊，在来这里之前我稍微修行过」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b6f9b404:



    voice "2FU_0486"
    fumi "「咦，在当宿管老师之前是个厨师吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_2c607bee:



    voice "2SA_0306"
    sachiko "「也不是那么正规的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_7f0a5e17:



    voice "2HI_0556"
    hina "「还早！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_e4d3949a:


    "伦刚要伸筷子，阳菜立马喝住了她。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_058b1289:



    voice "2HI_0557"
    hina "「还完全没热透吧。白菜也还很硬，豆腐也还没入味，螃蟹和章鱼也都还是生的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_d1b100d8:



    voice "2SA_0307"
    sachiko "「呵呵，有个掌锅人在所以接下来就放心交给她吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_3be53e2d:



    voice "2FU_0487"
    fumi "「是呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_2cd19107:


    "两个人笑着向起居室走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_7cbf06cc:



    voice "2RI_0571"
    rin "「咦，是吗？明明都煮得咕嘟咕嘟响了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_2937fcd2:



    voice "2HI_0558"
    hina "「啊？你没在家里吃过火锅吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_2d636652:



    voice "2RI_0572RE"
    rin "「没。我几乎没有和家人一起吃过饭」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_df92d0e8:



    voice "2HI_0559"
    hina "「啊……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_893e7d5c:



    voice "2SA_0308"
    sachiko "「那不是挺好的嘛。火锅初体验」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_147f378c:


    "祥子在坐下来的同时拍了拍伦的脑袋。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_dbf6d68d:



    voice "2RI_0573"
    rin "「嗯。嘛，和家人什么的没关系，只是单纯地没有烹饪经验而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_ad328678:



    voice "2SA_0309"
    sachiko "「你还是稍微做点吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_e4d18472:



    voice "2MI_0453"
    miyako "「我也是第一次吃火锅」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b19a4a1b:



    voice "2FU_0488"
    fumi "「真开心呀。大家一起吃得饱饱的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_aea51e72:



    voice "2SA_0310"
    sachiko "「交给你了哦，掌锅人！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_0e721697:



    voice "2HI_0560"
    hina "「嗯，交给我吧！话说，别突然开一瓶一升的酒啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_046e8069:



    voice "2SA_0311"
    sachiko "「本地酒也一起送来了！毕竟我是大人有啥不好！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_143bcddb:



    voice "2RI_0574"
    rin "「祥子姐你老家是哪里的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_42e6c424:



    voice "2SA_0312"
    sachiko "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_d8b1ece6:



    voice "2RI_0575"
    rin "「因为你拿来的食材的产地分散在各地，醋汁是四国的，而这酒不是东北的吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_61cfc501:


    "伦比对着醋和清酒瓶子上的标签。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b74736a6:



    voice "2SA_0313"
    sachiko "「啊，其实并不是从老家寄来的。是我在各地旅行的时候认识的人送来的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_e3f532a6:



    voice "2RI_0576"
    rin "「原来如此——喂」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_df098b6e:


    "正准备若无其事地向自己的杯子里倒清酒的伦被祥子打开了手。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_ec4251c4:



    voice "2HI_0561"
    hina "「旅行？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_5e8b6f8b:



    voice "2SA_0314"
    sachiko "「嗯，我一边画画一边在日本全国旅行」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_bcaa0244:



    voice "2HI_0562"
    hina "「一个人？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_1e4220ab:



    voice "2SA_0315"
    sachiko "「是啊。我到处都有前辈在，顺路去拜访了她们」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_3209f02d:



    voice "2FU_0489"
    fumi "「前辈？大学的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b52dc453:



    voice "2SA_0316"
    sachiko "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b39adb52:



    voice "2MI_0454"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_077d15ee:


    "这里只有圣夜子明白祥子口中的“前辈”的意思。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_6b0ad432:



    voice "2SA_0317"
    sachiko "「所以才叫做每个港口都有女生——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_e1ad6cae:



    voice "2RI_0577"
    rin "「好了好了，别说这个了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_e6014c09:



    voice "2MI_0455"
    miyako "「祥子姐，祥子姐」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_7332ef6a:



    voice "2SA_0318"
    sachiko "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_941b8a18:



    voice "2MI_0456"
    miyako "「这就是那个时候的画吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_7de78981:


    "圣夜子指着很随便地收拾起来的几张画布。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_214af378:



    voice "2SA_0319"
    sachiko "「啊，嗯，是的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_41d7977a:



    voice "2MI_0457"
    miyako "「可以让我看看吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_da7f8184:



    voice "2SA_0320"
    sachiko "「嗯，嘛……可以是可以，可我画得也没多好哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_f921ea1b:



    voice "2MI_0458"
    miyako "「谢谢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_e497db6a:



    voice "2FU_0490"
    fumi "「啊，我也想看看」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_bd3a148d:



    voice "2RI_0578"
    rin "「我看看我看看」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_1b4a0491:



    voice "2HI_0563"
    hina "「咦～要是裸体什么的就讨厌了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_22a325e4:


    "四个人拿起画布看了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_9e2e2a48:


    "不管哪一幅画的都是风景。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b6065be3:



    voice "2FU_0491"
    fumi "「哇……好厉害！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_b182b3d3:



    voice "2MI_0459"
    miyako "「嗯，颜色都非常棒呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_66d8b05f:


    "一边看着画布一边感叹的文和圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_741c99df:



    voice "2HI_0564"
    hina "「咦？不是裸体」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_399602da:



    voice "2RI_0579"
    rin "「太失望了。没有裸体吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_3ed9c3f3:



    voice "2SA_0321"
    sachiko "「没有哦。要是愿意做模特的话我随时都能画哦♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_ee3f954e:



    voice "2HI_0565"
    hina "「我拒绝！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_4c10c6af:



    voice "2RI_0580"
    rin "「作品真少啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_bc5fe442:


    "伦一边数画布一边说。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_338d9b44:



    voice "2SA_0322"
    sachiko "「我只想画自己喜欢的东西」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_08c53654:



    voice "2HI_0566"
    hina "「你做宿管之后还在旅行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_236988f5:



    voice "2SA_0323"
    sachiko "「暑假的时候，偶尔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_83e0158c:



    voice "2FU_0492"
    fumi "「一个人？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_5e73e3c0:



    voice "2SA_0324"
    sachiko "「嗯……我的旅行一直都是寂寞的感伤旅行哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_8f1de08b:



    voice "2RI_0581"
    rin "「祥子姐似乎会去弄什么寻找自我之类的旅行呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_0d3c390f:



    voice "2SA_0325"
    sachiko "「你们也是。年纪大了之后症状就会愈发严重。趁早吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_02640937:



    voice "2HI_0567"
    hina "「旅行之后有什么发现吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_64956dfc:



    voice "2SA_0326"
    sachiko "「不，什么都没。我现在也还在寻找」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_0faa69b6:



    voice "2MI_0460"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_aa703bf3:



    voice "2SA_0327"
    sachiko "「哟呵，锅煮好了哦。阳菜亲，可以吃了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_9273d525:



    voice "2HI_0568"
    hina "「嗯……好了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_a85fbdb6:


    "开动了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_6f564e77:



    voice "2SA_0328"
    sachiko "「呀，间接接吻～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_50f0e1c7:



    voice "2HI_0569"
    hina "「你给我用公筷！」"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_1ad488e1:


    voice "2FU_0489"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_12_a0149da7:


    fumi "「前辈？大学的？」"
